  "sections": [
    {
      "name": "Verse 1",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[G]God, who made [C/G]the [Am/C]earth [C]and heaven, [D]Darkness [D7]and light:",
        "[G]You the day [C/G]for [G]work [Am/C]have [C]given, [Bm]For [D]rest [Bm]the [D7]night.",
        "[G]May [C/G]Your [G]angel guards [C]defend [Am]us,",
        "[Am]Slumber sweet [Em/B]Your [C]mercy [Em/B]send [D/A]us,",
        "[G]Holy [C/G]dreams [Am/C]and [C]hopes [G]attend [D7]us",
        "[G]All through the night."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 2",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[G]And when morn [C/G]again [Am/C]shall [C]call [D/A]us [Bm]to [D]run [Bm]life's [D7]way,",
        "[G]May we still, [C/G]what-e'er [Am/C]befall [D/A]us, [Bm]Your [D]will [Bm]obey.",
        "[G]From [C/G]the [G]pow'r [C/G]of [G]evil [Bm]hide [Am]us,",
        "[Am]In [G/D]the [Am/C]narrow [C]pathway [Em/B]guide [D/A]us,",
        "[G]Never be [Am/C]Your [C]smile [D]denied [D7]us",
        "[G]All through the day."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 3",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[G]Guard us waking, [Am/C]guard [C]us sleeping, [D]And, [Bm]when [D7]we die,",
        "[G]May we in [C/G]Your [G]mighty [C]keeping [D/A]All [Bm]peaceful [D7]lie.",
        "[G]When [C/G]the [G]trumpet call [C]shall [Bm]wake [Am]us, [G#m]Then,",
        "[G]O Lord, do [C]not [D/A]forsake [D7]us,",
        "[G]But to reign in glory take us with You on high."
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Verse 4",
      "type": "verse",
      "lines": [
        "[G]Holy Father, [Am/C]throned [C]in heaven, [D]All [Bm]holy [D7]Son,",
        "[G]Holy Spirit, freely [C]given, [Bm]Blest [D]Three [Bm]in [D7]One:",
        "[G]Grant [C/G]us [G]grace, [C/G]we [G]now [C]implore [Am]You,",
        "[G]Till we lay [Am/C]our [C]crowns [G]before [D7]You",
        "[G]And in worthier strains adore You while ages run."
      ]
    }
  ],
  "meter": "12.12.8.8.9.4"
